# Domains commonly known to refuse traffic from RU IPs.
# Sourced from public lists (dartraiden/no-russia-hosts) and personal curation.
# One domain per line; lines starting with # are comments.
#
# This file is a *reference* the LuCI probe UI uses to suggest candidates.
# It does NOT route anything by itself -- it just feeds the probe and the
# (future) must-tunnel list in Plan B.
#
# Bias: short and high-signal. Add domains you actually use and that you want
# to verify-or-route-via-AWG; a maintained big list lives in dartraiden's repo.

# AI / dev tooling that bans RU IPs
chatgpt.com
openai.com
claude.ai
anthropic.com
gemini.google.com
github.com
copilot.microsoft.com

# Streaming / media that geo-block RU
netflix.com
hbo.com
hbomax.com
disneyplus.com
spotify.com
hulu.com
paramountplus.com

# News
nytimes.com
washingtonpost.com
bbc.com
ft.com
bloomberg.com

# Misc commonly-affected services
notion.so
slack.com
linear.app
stripe.com
docker.com
gradle.org
